<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.10 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.10 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday the average rate in a seven-day Treasury bill auction was 4.10 percent.  </p>
<p>The highest accepted rate was 4.10 percent and the lowest rate was 4.08 percent, the office said.</p>
<p>It served 100 percent at the highest rate, it said.</p>
<p>The T-bill will run from February 5 to 12.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
